claim.claim-text:
wherein said trabecular region comprises a three-dimensional textured region made of a digital material combining a first material and a second material in in a voxel-interlaced manner;
wherein a hardness of said cortical region is higher than an overall hardness of said trabecular region, and a hardness of said core region is lower than an overall hardness of said trabecular region; and
wherein said first material has a tensile strength of from about 40 to about 60 MPa according to ASTM D-638-03 and a modulus of elasticity of from about 1000 MPa to about 2600 MPa according to ASTM D-638-04, and said second material has a modulus of elasticity of from about 10 kPa to about 100 kPa according to ASTM D-575.
